Q:6
A = {1, 2, 3, 4}
B = {3, 4, 5, 6}

# 1. Union
print("Union:", A | B)

# 2. Intersection
print("Intersection:", A & B)

# 3. Difference
print("A - B:", A - B)
print("B - A:", B - A)

# 4. Symmetric Difference
print("Symmetric Difference:", A ^ B)

Output:

Union: {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6}
Intersection: {3, 4}
A - B: {1, 2}
B - A: {5, 6}
Symmetric Difference: {1, 2, 5, 6}
